1. WHO THESE TERMS APPLY TO
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

1.1  "You" means the person or business that uses the App.

1.2  An "Owner" is the account that first registers the business and
     controls settings, team members, backups, and data reset.

1.3  "Staff" are additional users invited by an Owner. Staff use the same
     business records as the Owner, within the access the App provides.

1.4  If you use the App on behalf of a business, you confirm that you
     have authority to accept these terms for that business.

1.5  The App is intended for ordinary small-shop and trading records.
     You must be allowed under the law of your country to use business
     software and to enter into these terms.

