4. ACCOUNTS, ACCESS, AND SECURITY
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

4.1  You must provide accurate registration details and keep your
     password secret.

4.2  You are responsible for activity that happens under your login,
     including activity by Staff you invite.

4.3  Owners should remove Staff who no longer work for the business.

4.4  Notify us promptly if you believe an account has been misused.

4.5  We may suspend an account that appears compromised, abusive, or
     in breach of these terms, in order to protect the service and
     other users.

4.6  Feature "modes" (for example Shop, Books, Office, Full, Quiet, or
     Custom) only change which parts of the App are shown or run. They
