------------------------------------------------------------------------------
5. ACCEPTABLE USE
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

You agree to use the App only for lawful business records. You must not:

     (a) enter data you have no right to store;
     (b) impersonate another person or business;
     (c) upload malware or harmful code;
     (d) interfere with other businesses that share a hosted platform;
     (e) use the App for spam or unsolicited bulk messages;
     (f) try to bypass payment, access, or mode limits if any are set;
     (g) use automated tools in a way that harms the service.

We may remove content or restrict access where we reasonably believe
these rules have been broken.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
6. YOUR BUSINESS DATA
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

6.1  Records are stored against the Owner's business. Staff see that
     same business data.

6.2  You are responsible for the accuracy of figures you type in
     (prices, quantities, tax rates, names, and dates).

6.3  You should keep your own backups. Settings include a JSON export.
     Hosting providers and database providers can fail. Do not treat
     the App as your only copy of important records.

6.4  The Owner may use "clear data" to wipe business records and start
     again. That action cannot be undone from inside the App. The Owner
     login itself is not deleted by a data clear unless separately
     removed.

6.5  If you use a hosted copy, the host and database provider process
     data under their own terms as well as these terms.

6.6  If you self-host, you are the controller of the server, the
     database, and any backups you take.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
7. MONEY, TAX, AND PROFESSIONAL LIMITS
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

7.1  Currency symbols and decimal places follow the Settings you choose
     and are used on screens, PDFs, and exports. You must choose a
     currency that matches how you actually trade.

7.2  Totals, profit and loss, cash flow, tax estimates, budgets, and
     day-close figures are calculations from the data you entered. They
     can be wrong if the data is wrong or incomplete.

7.3  The App is a practical record keeper for small traders. It is not:
     (a) a replacement for a qualified accountant or auditor;
     (b) tax advice, legal advice, or financial advice;
     (c) a guarantee that your books meet the rules of any country;
     (d) a certified fiscal device or official tax filing system.

7.4  You remain responsible for invoices, receipts, payroll, tax
     filings, and any papers you issue to customers or authorities.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
8. FEATURES AND AVAILABILITY
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

8.1  Modules may include dashboard, stock, sales, counter / till,
     customers, services (teaching, coaching, and similar work), Stripe card collection, suppliers, purchase orders, book keeping documents,
     account tracking, budgets, recurring items, reports, statistics,
     documents, SWOT and business plan, tasks, notes, calendar,
     reminders, tax estimate, calculator, day close, team, settings,
     notifications, and search. Availability depends on your mode and
     deployment.

8.2  We may add, change, or remove features. Reasonable effort will be
     made not to destroy your stored data when features change.

8.3  Hosted copies may be offline for maintenance, hosting limits, or
     events outside our control. No uptime is guaranteed unless a
     separate written service level is agreed.

8.4  Optional email (for example a daily summary) needs working mail
     settings. If mail is not configured, those messages will not send.

